        {
            "name": "Enumerate Domain",
            "event": [
                {
                    "listen": "test",
                    "script": {
                        "exec": [""],
                        "type": "text/javascript",
                        "packages": {},
                        "requests": {}
                    }
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n    \"domain\": \"httpbin.org\"\n}",
                    "options": {
                        "raw": {
                            "language": "json"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{base_url}}/enumerate",
                    "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                    "path": ["enumerate"]
                },
                "description": "Start passive subdomain enumeration for a given domain using OWASP Amass.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /enumerate`\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n    \"domain\": \"example.com\"\n}\n```\n\n**Description:**\nThis endpoint triggers a comprehensive passive reconnaissance process:\n1. Runs Amass in passive mode to discover subdomains\n2. Validates discovered subdomains (DNS resolution, HTTP accessibility)\n3. Resolves IP addresses for active subdomains\n4. Performs WHOIS lookup on the main domain\n5. Generates security findings\n6. Saves results in JSON format\n\n**Response Structure:**\n- `success`: Boolean indicating operation success\n- `data`: EnumerationResult object containing:\n  - `domain`: The enumerated domain\n  - `timestamp`: ISO timestamp of the enumeration\n  - `total_subdomains`: Total number of discovered subdomains\n  - `active_subdomains`: Number of subdomains with active services\n  - `subdomains`: Array of all subdomain information\n  - `active`: Array of active subdomains\n  - `inactive`: Array of inactive subdomains\n  - `whois_info`: WHOIS information (if available)\n- `metadata`: Processing metadata\n\n**Status Codes:**\n- `200 OK`: Enumeration completed successfully\n- `400 Bad Request`: Invalid domain format or missing domain parameter\n- `500 Internal Server Error`: Enumeration process failed\n\n**Processing Time:**\nEnumeration typically takes 2-5 minutes depending on:\n- Domain size and complexity\n- Number of discovered subdomains\n- Network conditions\n\n**Example Response:**\n```json\n{\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"data\": {\n        \"domain\": \"example.com\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"total_subdomains\": 15,\n        \"active_subdomains\": 8,\n        \"subdomains\": [...],\n        \"active\": [...],\n        \"inactive\": [...],\n        \"whois_info\": {...}\n    },\n    \"metadata\": {\n        \"processingTime\": \"2026-01-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"totalSubdomains\": 15,\n        \"activeSubdomains\": 8\n    }\n}\n```"
            },
            "response": [
                {
                    "name": "Success",
                    "originalRequest": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"domain\": \"example.com\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/enumerate",
                            "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["enumerate"]
                        }
                    },
                    "status": "OK",
                    "code": 200,
                    "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                    "header": [
                        {
                            "key": "Content-Type",
                            "value": "application/json"
                        }
                    ],
                    "cookie": [],
                    "body": "{\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"data\": {\n        \"domain\": \"example.com\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"total_subdomains\": 15,\n        \"active_subdomains\": 8,\n        \"subdomains\": [\n            {\n                \"name\": \"www.example.com\",\n                \"dns_resolves\": true,\n                \"http_accessible\": true,\n                \"ip_addresses\": [\"93.184.216.34\"],\n                \"details\": {\n                    \"accessible\": true,\n                    \"status_code\": 200,\n                    \"protocol\": \"https\",\n                    \"url\": \"https://www.example.com\"\n                }\n            }\n        ],\n        \"active\": [],\n        \"inactive\": [],\n        \"whois_info\": {\n            \"registrar\": \"Example Registrar\",\n            \"creation_date\": \"1995-01-01\",\n            \"expiration_date\": \"2025-01-01\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"metadata\": {\n        \"processingTime\": \"2026-01-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"totalSubdomains\": 15,\n        \"activeSubdomains\": 8\n    }\n}"
                },
