                    "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans",
                    "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                    "path": ["scans"]
                },
                "description": "Retrieve a list of all previous enumeration scan results.\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /scans`\n\n**Description:**\nReturns a list of all saved scan results in JSON format. Each scan result includes:\n- Filename of the saved JSON file\n- API path to retrieve the specific scan\n\n**Response Structure:**\n- `count`: Total number of scans\n- `scans`: Array of scan items with:\n  - `filename`: Name of the JSON file\n  - `path`: API endpoint path to retrieve the scan\n\n**Status Codes:**\n- `200 OK`: Successfully retrieved scan list\n- `500 Internal Server Error`: Failed to read scan directory\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Browse previous enumeration results\n- Track enumeration history\n- Retrieve specific scan filenames for detailed retrieval"
            },
